<doc id="177858" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177858" title="Alina Kukushkina">
Alina Kukushkina

Alina Illinichna Kukushkina (Basa &lt;a href="Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Алина Ильинична Кукушкина; lair ing &lt;a href="Moskou"&gt;Moskou&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="26%20September"&gt;26 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;) karo julukan Alina Kukushkina, yaiku &lt;a href="Aktris"&gt;Aktris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pangisi%20Swara"&gt;Pangisi Swara&lt;/a&gt; kebangsaan &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Alina dikenal dadi pangisi swarane Masha sejak mangsa 1. 
Alina dadi dikenal masarakat amarga lagu &lt;a href="Masha%20and%20the%20Bear"&gt;Masha and the Bear&lt;/a&gt; kanthi judhul Tahan Napasmu! sing dirilis ing youtube &lt;a href="Vasily%20Bogatyrev"&gt;Vasily Bogatyrev&lt;/a&gt;.
Alina melu dadi &lt;a href="Pangisi%20Swara"&gt;Pangisi Swara&lt;/a&gt; Agnes ing kartun Despicable me, Olympia ing kartun Norm of the North, Cara Lockwood ing film The Change Up, lan Dee Dee Eytenton ing film Dream House.
<h2>Dikenal Masarakat</h2>
Dikenal Masarakat.
Alina dingerteni karo masarakat amarga lagu ing kartun &lt;a href="Masha%20and%20the%20Bear"&gt;Masha and the Bear&lt;/a&gt; kanthi judhul Tahan Napasmu! sing diunggahake ing YouTube karo &lt;a href="Vasily%20Bogatyrev"&gt;Vasily Bogatyrev&lt;/a&gt;. Video kuwi wis ditonton luwih saka 4 yuta kaping.
Ing 2015, Alina mandheg dadi pangisi swarane Masha ing episode 52. Alina pindhah dadi pangisi swarane Dasha. Alina diganti karo &lt;a href="Varvara%20Sarantseva"&gt;Varvara Sarantseva&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun 2015. Sawise iku pangisi suarane Masha diganti meneh karo &lt;a href="Yulia%20Zunikova"&gt;Yulia Zunikova&lt;/a&gt; wiwit taun 2020.
