<doc id="177955" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177955" title="Pepperpot Guyana">
Pepperpot Guyana

Pepperpot iku sawijining &lt;a href="Wong%20Indian"&gt;Amerindian&lt;/a&gt; sajian populer ing &lt;a href="Guyana"&gt;Guyana&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane dilayani ing &lt;a href="Natal"&gt;Natal&lt;/a&gt; lan acara khusus liyane. Bebarengan karo &lt;a href="kari%20pitik"&gt;kari pitik&lt;/a&gt;, lan nasi masak, panci minangka salah sawijining sajian nasional Guyana. 
Pepperpot punika &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;stewed&lt;/a&gt; meat sajian, banget roso karo &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cassareep"&gt;cassareep&lt;/a&gt; (a sauce khusus digawe saka &lt;a href="Ket%C3%A9la%20pohung"&gt;tela&lt;/a&gt; ROOT) lan bahan dhasar liyane, kalebu panas mrico Karibia. &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;Daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;daging kambing minangka daging&lt;/a&gt; sing paling populer sing digunakake, sanajan ana sing ngerti nggunakake &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;. Pepperpot populer disajikake kanthi roti buatan, gandum, utawa roti gaya griyana, utawa roti gaya omah. &lt;a href="Eddoe"&gt;Uga bisa disedhiyakake&lt;/a&gt; karo sayuran sing digodhog kayata singkong, eddoes, ubi jalar, lan tanduran ijo utawa mateng.
