<doc id="177971" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=177971" title="Lai fun">
Lai fun

Lai fun minangka macem-macem &lt;a href="Mi%20China"&gt;mi mi Cina sing&lt;/a&gt; cendhak lan kenthel. Umume ditemokake ing wilayah Delta Sungai Mutiara lan sawetara derajat ing antarane Chinatowns luar negeri. Jeneng kasebut asale saka &lt;a href="Basa%20Kwangtung"&gt;basa Kanton&lt;/a&gt;.
Lai fun bisa uga diarani &lt;a href="B%C3%A1nh%20canh"&gt;canh bhanh&lt;/a&gt; dening wong Vietnam, mula digawe saka &lt;a href="glepung%20beras"&gt;glepung beras&lt;/a&gt; lan pati &lt;a href="Tapioka"&gt;tapioka.&lt;/a&gt;

