<li>Bouilli Acadien - nedha bengi rebus sing kalebu kentang, daging sapi asin utawa daging babi, wortel, kacang ijo, kubis lan turnip.</li>
<li>Bouillie à la viande salée</li>
<li>Bouillon aux coques</li>
<li>Chiard / Mioche— kentang, wortel lan / utawa turnip.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Chow-chow"&gt;Chow-Chow&lt;/a&gt; - nikmati pickled ing Amerika Utara.</li>
<li>Cipâte - pie sagara</li>
<li>Coques frites - &lt;a href="Kerang%20gor%C3%A8ng"&gt;gorengan goreng&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Coquille Saint-Jacques - sajian kerang sagara.</li>
<li>Cretons Jinis -a saka nggodhok, lemah daging babi &lt;a href="P%C3%A2t%C3%A9"&gt;sosis&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20iwak"&gt;Croquettes de poisson&lt;/a&gt; —fishcake.</li>
<li>Doigt-à-l'Ail - driji bawang putih</li>
