<doc id="178015" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178015" title="Oladyi">
Oladyi

Oladyi (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: оладьи pl., diminutive: оладушки, oladushki, sg. оладья, oladya ; &lt;a href="basa%20Basa%20Ukrania"&gt;Basa Ukrania&lt;/a&gt;: оладки, oladky, sg. оладок, oladok utawa оладка, oladka &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dhadhar"&gt;) minangka pancake&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20celup"&gt;fritters&lt;/a&gt; kenthel cilik sing umume ana ing masakan &lt;a href="Masakan%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olahan%20Ukrainia"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Belarusia"&gt;Belarus.&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;Adonan&lt;/a&gt; oladyi digawe saka gandum utawa (saiki luwih asring) tepung soba, endhog, susu, uyah lan gula nganggo &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Soda%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;soda roti&lt;/a&gt;. Adonan uga bisa didhasarake kefir, susu asem utawa yoghurt. Bisa uga ngemot macem-macem tambahan, kayata &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="kismis"&gt;kismis&lt;/a&gt;. 
Oladyi biasane disajik nganggo &lt;a href="Sm%C3%A9tana"&gt;smetana&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="krim%20asem"&gt;krim asem&lt;/a&gt;), uga nganggo topping manis kayata &lt;a href="varenye"&gt;varenye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;jam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="powidl"&gt;powidl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt; lsp. Versi gurih bisa uga &lt;a href="Kaviar"&gt;disedhiyakake&lt;/a&gt; karo kaviar, padha karo &lt;a href="blini"&gt;blini&lt;/a&gt;.
Umumé, ing oladyi term masakan Eastern Slavic bisa fritters uga ndudohke digawe karo úa, eg &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20dadar%20kenthang"&gt;potato pancakes&lt;/a&gt; (картофельные оладьи), fritters wortel (морковные оладьи), kacang pancakes (оладьи из бобовых), pancake beras (рисовые оладьи), frashers labu panas (кабачковые оладьи) lsp. &lt;a href="Syrniki"&gt;Syrniki&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Quark"&gt;pancake quark&lt;/a&gt;) uga bisa dianggep minangka jinis oladyi.
