Jagung kacang

Kacang jagung, uga dikenal minangka jagung toasted, quico, utawa Cracker sing &lt;a href="Nyamikan"&gt;cemilan&lt;/a&gt; panganan saka &lt;a href="Bakar"&gt;panggang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;jero-goreng&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wiji"&gt;kernels&lt;/a&gt;. Iki diarani cancha ing &lt;a href="Peru"&gt;Peru&lt;/a&gt; lan chulpi ing &lt;a href="%C3%89kuador"&gt;Ekuador&lt;/a&gt;. Perkakas jagung sing disiapake dening soaking kabèh kernels jagung ing &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; telung dina, banjur digoreng &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;jero&lt;/a&gt; mau ing lenga nganti padha hard lan brittle. Kernel direndhem amarga sithik nalika panen lan proses reresik, lan rehidrasi ngasilake ukuran asline.
