<doc id="178068" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178068" title="Bolo de arroz">
Bolo de arroz

Bolo de arroz minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa muffin pari &lt;a href="Portegal"&gt;Portugis&lt;/a&gt; umume ing Portugal, negara lan wilayah Lusosfer &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;(sing kalebu Brasil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Angola"&gt;Angola&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mozambik"&gt;Mozambik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pongol%20Verd%C3%A9"&gt;Cape Verde&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sao%20Tom%C3%A9%20lan%20Princip%C3%A9"&gt;São Tomé lan Príncipe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Guin%C3%A9a-Bissau"&gt;Guinea-Bissau&lt;/a&gt;, Timor, &lt;a href="Timor%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Timor Leste&lt;/a&gt;, Goa, &lt;a href="Melaka"&gt;Malaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Makau"&gt;Macau&lt;/a&gt;) lan negara-negara sing nduwe populasi imigran Portugis sing signifikan, kayata &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Luksemburg"&gt;Luksemburg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane.
