<doc id="178099" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178099" title="Pudhing persimmon">
Pudhing persimmon

Puding persimmon minangka panganan cuci mulut &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;tradisional Amerika sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe karo persimon. Sanajan Amerika, puding persimmon padha karo &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; panganan &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;cuci mulut tradisional Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, kayata &lt;a href="Pudhing%20natal"&gt;puding Natal&lt;/a&gt; (kismis utawa ara) utawa puding quince. Gaya puding iki umume &lt;a href="Kukus"&gt;dikukus&lt;/a&gt; utawa dimasak ing oven kanthi adus banyu (uga diarani bain-marie). Cara masak iki mesthekake, puding tetep lembab lan ora garing utawa ora kerak ora kaya roti persimmon sing legi nanging kepareng.
Puding asring disedhiyakake nganggo &lt;a href="%C3%88s%20krim"&gt;es krim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cr%C3%A8me%20anglaise"&gt;crème anglaise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="krim%20kocok"&gt;krim kocok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="saos%20apel"&gt;saos apel&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Saos%20atos"&gt;saos keras&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga diarani saus brendi. Biasane diwenehi anget, sanajan bisa uga adhem. Puding persimmon cukup suwe nalika didinginkan, lan bisa digawe kanthi akeh supaya bisa ditindakake sajrone pirang-pirang dina. Minangka puding umure macem-macem rasa rasa empuk lan campuran.

