<doc id="178100" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178100" title="Pudhing ratu">
Pudhing ratu

Ratu Pudding minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;cuci mulut tradisional Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu campuran roti pekat, roti kenthel, disebar nganggo &lt;a href="S%C3%A9l%C3%A9%20woh"&gt;selai&lt;/a&gt; lan ditambah karo &lt;a href="meringue"&gt;meringue&lt;/a&gt;. Resep sing padha diarani Monmouth Pudding lan Manchester Pudding. 
