<doc id="178108" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178108" title="Herrencreme">
Herrencreme

Herrencreme minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Iki minangka &lt;a href="Vanila"&gt;puding vanili sing&lt;/a&gt; dicampur karo &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Soklat"&gt;serutan coklat&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;rum sing akeh&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane Herrencreme minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20cuci%20mulut"&gt;panganan cuci mulut sing&lt;/a&gt; dipangan sawise panganan gedhe, kayata pesta.
