<doc id="178136" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178136" title="Sohan halwa">
Sohan halwa

Sohan halwa (&lt;a href="Basa%20Urdu"&gt;Urdu&lt;/a&gt; سوہن حلوہ; [ˈSoːɦən ˈɦəlʋaː]) minangka panganan &lt;a href="Asia%20Kidul"&gt;cuci mulut tradisional ing Asia Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku macem-macem rasa &lt;a href="Olahan%20legi"&gt;manis&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Halva"&gt;halwa sing&lt;/a&gt; padhet. Gheewala halwa misuwur karo sohan halwa wiwit jaman &lt;a href="Jaman%20Mughal"&gt;Mughal&lt;/a&gt;. Ana atusan toko sing ngasilake sohan halwa ing kutha &lt;a href="Multan"&gt;Multan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Punjab%2C%20Pakistan"&gt;Punjab&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Dera%20Ismail%20Khan"&gt;Dera Ismail Khan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Khyber%20Pakhtunkhwa"&gt;Khyber Pakhtunkhwa&lt;/a&gt;), lan &lt;a href="Old%20Delhi"&gt;Old Delhi&lt;/a&gt;.
Digawe kanthi nggodhok campuran &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;tepung jagung&lt;/a&gt; nganti padhet. Saffron digunakake kanggo nggawe rasa. &lt;a href="Lenga%20samin"&gt;Ghee&lt;/a&gt; digunakake kanggo nyegah nemplek ing wajan. Almond, pistachios, lan wiji kapulaga ditambahake. Beda karo panganan halwa liyane ing bawana India, padhet padhet, padha karo mitra Timur Tengah.
