<doc id="178146" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178146" title="Almond bubuk">
Almond bubuk

Panganan kacang almond, glepung almond utawa almond saka lemah digawe saka kacang almond &lt;a href="Almond"&gt;sing direndhem&lt;/a&gt;. Glepung almond biasane digawe karo almond blanched (ora ana kulit), dene panganan almond bisa digawe almond utuh utawa blanched. Konsistensi luwih kaya &lt;a href="S%C3%A9real%20jagung"&gt;panganan jagung&lt;/a&gt; tinimbang &lt;a href="glepung%20gandum"&gt;glepung gandum&lt;/a&gt;. Iki digunakake ing &lt;a href="Pastry"&gt;jajanan&lt;/a&gt; lan resep - ing produksi &lt;a href="Macaron"&gt;macarons&lt;/a&gt; almond lan &lt;a href="Macaroon"&gt;macaroons&lt;/a&gt; lan kue-kue manis liyane, ing &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;jajan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pai"&gt;pie&lt;/a&gt;, kayata &lt;a href="Sachertort%C3%A9"&gt;Sachertorte&lt;/a&gt; - lan minangka salah sawijining bahan utama &lt;a href="Tempel%20kacang%20almond"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="marzipan"&gt;marzipan&lt;/a&gt; lan almond. Ing Prancis, panganan kacang almond minangka bahan penting ing &lt;a href="frangipane"&gt;frangipane&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku ngisi &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20raja"&gt;kue galette des Rois&lt;/a&gt; tradisional.

