Pain d'épices

Pain d'épices utawa pain d'épice (French, diterjemahake kanthi &lt;a href="Roti%20ja%C3%A9"&gt;ringkes minangka salah￼￼ sawijining jinis olahan arupa roti jahe&lt;/a&gt; sanajan ora kaya roti jahe) yaiku &lt;a href="Bolu"&gt;kue&lt;/a&gt; Prancis utawa &lt;a href="roti%20cepet"&gt;roti cepet&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan-bahane, miturut &lt;a href="Le%20Dictionnaire%20de%20l%27Acad%C3%A9mie%20fran%C3%A7aise"&gt;Le Dictionnaire de l'Académie française&lt;/a&gt; (1694), yaiku " &lt;a href="Gandum%20ireng"&gt;tepung gandum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bumbon%20crak%C3%A8n"&gt;rempah-rempah&lt;/a&gt; ". Ing &lt;a href="Alsace"&gt;Alsace&lt;/a&gt;, sawijining tradhisi sing cukup ngemot &lt;a href="Kayu%20legi"&gt;kayu manis&lt;/a&gt;.

