Mohnyin tjin

Mohnyin Tjin, (မုန်ညင်းချဉ်] ; uga Mon Nyin Jin, Mohn-hnyin Gyin) minangka &lt;a href="Olahan%20Burma"&gt;panganan khas Myanmar sing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fermentasi%20panganan"&gt;difermentasi&lt;/a&gt; sajian sayuran sing disimpen ing anggur beras lan maneka bumbu. Mirip karo &lt;a href="Kimchi"&gt;Kimchi&lt;/a&gt; Korea lan &lt;a href="Tsukemono"&gt;Takana Tsukemono&lt;/a&gt; Jepang. Mohnyin Tjin misuwur digandhengake karo Shan lan minangka bumbu ing endi-endi kanggo panganan Shan kayata &lt;a href="meeshay"&gt;meeshay&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Meeshay"&gt;shan khauk swè&lt;/a&gt;. Mohnnyin tjin nuduhake akeh sayuran acar lan fermentasi. Jeneng kasebut tegese " &lt;a href="ijo%20sawi"&gt;ijo sawi&lt;/a&gt; asem" lan &lt;a href="Lobak"&gt;godhong lobak&lt;/a&gt; putih acar uga digunakake ing versi sing paling umum.

