<h2>Bahan-bahan</h2>
Bahan-bahan.
Ing Prancis, bonbon biasane digawe karo pusat buah, lan bisa uga ngemot &lt;a href="Roti%20gapuk"&gt;rapuh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="nougat"&gt;nougat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="drag%C3%A9e"&gt;dragée&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Karam%C3%A8l"&gt;karamel&lt;/a&gt;. Ing jagad Kulon, bonbon biasane uga permen cilik, nanging bisa beda-beda miturut bahan, rasa lan bentuk. Jinis isi liyane kalebu &lt;a href="butterscotch"&gt;butterscotch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Petit%20g%C3%A2teau"&gt;fondant&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="fudge"&gt;fudge&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ganach%C3%A9"&gt;ganache&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gianduja%20%28coklat%29"&gt;gianduja&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="marzipan"&gt;marzipan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="praline"&gt;praline&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Truffle%20soklat"&gt;truffle&lt;/a&gt;. 
