<doc id="178241" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178241" title="Praline">
Praline

Praline (;) iku salah sawijining jinis olahan wangun &lt;a href="Olahan%20legi"&gt;confection&lt;/a&gt; ngemot ing minimal kuliner &lt;a href="Kacang%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;perkakas&lt;/a&gt;, biasane almonds lan hazelnuts, lan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim&lt;/a&gt; minangka bahan katelu sing umum.

