<doc id="178245" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178245" title="Divinity">
Divinity

Ketuhanan minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Olahan%20legi"&gt;gula-gula&lt;/a&gt; kaya &lt;a href="nougat"&gt;nougat&lt;/a&gt; digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Putih%20endhog"&gt;endhog putih&lt;/a&gt;, sirup jagung, lan &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan opsional kayata rasa, &lt;a href="Woh%20garing"&gt;woh garing sing&lt;/a&gt; dicincang lan &lt;a href="Kacang%20woh"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; sing dicincang asring ditambahake. Ngganti gula karo gula &lt;a href="Gula%20soklat"&gt;coklat nyebabake gula sing ana&lt;/a&gt; gandhengane sing diarani " &lt;a href="Dalgona"&gt;busa laut&lt;/a&gt; ".

