<li>Sayuran: &lt;a href="tomat"&gt;tomat&lt;/a&gt; anggur, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;cabai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T%C3%A9rong"&gt;aubergine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Zukini"&gt;courgette&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Kacang- &lt;a href="Buncis"&gt;kacangan: kacang-kacangan tali&lt;/a&gt; putih sing garing (diarani guixon ing pulau kasebut).</li>
<li>Sayuran ijo: chard, &lt;a href="Bayem%20kebon"&gt;bayam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kapri"&gt;kacang polong&lt;/a&gt; (diarani fesol ing pulau), &lt;a href="Kul"&gt;Gobis&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Woh-wohan: ara, &lt;a href="Persik"&gt;peach&lt;/a&gt;, apricot, pir, &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28woh%29"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jeruk"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jeruk nipis&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Kacang-kacangan: tanggal, &lt;a href="Almond"&gt;kacang almond&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kacang%20pinus"&gt;kacang cemara&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Daging: &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kelinci"&gt;terwelu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, potongan adhem.</li>
<li>Jamur: tutup susu safron, jamur garing.</li>
<li>Liyane: minyak zaitun, &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="madu"&gt;madu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="caper"&gt;caper&lt;/a&gt;, anggur, endhog, siput, &lt;a href="ricotta"&gt;ricotta&lt;/a&gt;, figat (padha karo kue ara Spanyol lan &lt;a href="meringue"&gt;meringue&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
</ul>
