<doc id="178265" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178265" title="Huangjiu">
Huangjiu

Huangjiu (Chinese), tegese anggur kuning, minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa &lt;a href="Omb%C3%A8nan%20ngandhut%20alkohol"&gt;minuman beralkohol&lt;/a&gt; Tionghoa, lan paling populer ing wilayah Jiangnan. Huangjiu diseduh kanthi nyawiji gandum sing digodhog kalebu &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="beras%20ketan"&gt;beras ketan&lt;/a&gt; utawa millet karo Qū minangka budaya wiwitan, disusul karo saccharification lan &lt;a href="Fermentasi%20panganan"&gt;fermentasi&lt;/a&gt; udakara jam 13-18&amp;nbsp;° C kanggo wayah bengi. Kandhungan alkohol biasane 8% -20%.

