Kukis krim godhong mapel

Cookie krim daun maple (uga diarani "cookie creme leaf creme", "cookie leaf maple", "cookie maple creme", "cremes leaf maple", lan "maple cremes") minangka &lt;a href="Kukis"&gt;cookie&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kukis%20isi"&gt;sandwich&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;.Isi krim arupa maple, lan bisa uga ngemot sirup maple nyata. Cookie bentuke kaya godhong maple, simbol nasional Kanada.

