Olahan Yunani

Masakan Yunani (&lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Ελληνική Κουζίνα) yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan saka masakan Yunani lan diaspora Yunani. Umume karo panganan liyane ing Mediterania, didhasarake ing telung &lt;a href="Gandhum"&gt;gandum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;minyak zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Anggur%20%28omb%C3%A8n-omb%C3%A8n%29"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt;. Iki nggunakake sayuran, minyak zaitun, pari-parian, iwak, lan daging, kalebu &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="unggas"&gt;unggas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20sapi%20enom"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daging%20domba"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kelinci"&gt;terwelu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Iwak%20wedhus"&gt;wedhus&lt;/a&gt;. Bahan-bahan penting liyane kalebu pasta (contone &lt;a href="Hilopites"&gt;hilopite&lt;/a&gt;), keju, jus lemon, jamu, zaitun, lan &lt;a href="Yoghurt"&gt;yogurt&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Roti"&gt;Roti sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka gandum ana ing endi-endi; pari-parian liyane, utamane gandum, uga digunakake, utamane kanggo paximathia. Bahan panganan cuci mulut umum kalebu kacang, madu, woh-wohan, lan kue-kue &lt;a href="Filo"&gt;filo.&lt;/a&gt; Terusake tradhisi saka masakan Yunani Kuno lan Bizantium, nalika nggabungake pengaruh &lt;a href="Olahan%20W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;Timur Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, Balkan lan &lt;a href="Olahan%20Itali"&gt;Italia.&lt;/a&gt;
