<doc id="178492" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178492" title="Bánh bao">
Bánh bao

Bánh bao (secara harfiah "cake bun") minangka salah sawijining jinis olahan arupa bun &lt;a href="Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; adhedhasar da bao &lt;a href="Basa%20Kwangtung"&gt;Kanton&lt;/a&gt; (大 包, secara harfiah "bun big") sing digawa menyang Vietnam dening para imigran Kanton. Iki minangka roti berbentuk bal sing ngemot &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;daging pitik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;masakan Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;. Asring nganggo &lt;a href="Sosis%20China"&gt;sosis Tionghoa&lt;/a&gt; lan bagean &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog sing wis&lt;/a&gt; umob ing jero. Bánh bao umume luwih gedhe tinimbang &lt;a href="Bakpao"&gt;baozi&lt;/a&gt;, lan diisi karo isine gurih, sing paling umum yaiku &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt; lan endhog puyuh. Versi vegetarian bánh bao uga ana. 
