<doc id="178505" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=178505" title="Chili dog">
Chili dog

Chili dog minangka jeneng umum kanggo &lt;a href="Hot%20dog"&gt;asu panas sing&lt;/a&gt; disajikake ing roti lan diwenehi saus daging, kayata &lt;a href="Chili%20con%20carne"&gt;cabai&lt;/a&gt;. Asring topping liyane uga ditambahake, kayata &lt;a href="K%C3%A8ju"&gt;keju&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="mustar"&gt;mustar&lt;/a&gt;. Gaya kasebut nduweni macem-macem variasi regional ing Amerika Serikat, akeh sing nyebut bahan saos khusus lan unik, jinis asu panas, utawa jinis roti lan diarani wilayah kanthi jeneng khusus wilayah.
