Iki minangka salah sawijining saka 4 koran nasional ing Jepang; telu liyane yaiku &lt;a href="Yomiuri%20Shimbun"&gt;Yomiuri Shimbun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mainichi%20Shimbun"&gt;Mainichi Shimbun&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="The%20Nikkei"&gt;Nihon Keizai Shimbun&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Sankei%20Shimbun"&gt;Sankei Shimbun&lt;/a&gt; saiki ora ing posisi sawijining koran nasional. &lt;a href="Chunichi%20Shimbun"&gt;Chunichi Shimbun&lt;/a&gt; dudu koran nasional, nanging iku koran gedhe.
